            <ArticleTitle>Retrobulbar hemorrhage after sub-Tenon's anesthesia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1651-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of retrobulbar hemorrhage complicating sub-Tenon's anesthesia in a patient receiving oral anticoagulants. To our knowledge, this has been described only once in the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
